      <p begin="00:28.230" end="00:29.730" ttm:agent="v1">And every time I see her</p>
      <p begin="00:29.530" end="00:31.180" ttm:agent="v1">She makes me get this feeling</p>
      <p begin="00:31.180" end="00:32.680" ttm:agent="v1">It feels just like I'm dreaming</p>
      <p begin="00:32.360" end="00:34.450" ttm:agent="v1">Gets me higher than the ceiling</p>
      <p begin="00:34.450" end="00:36.770" ttm:agent="v1">Studded belt, pretty blue long hair</p>
      <p begin="00:36.770" end="00:38.270" ttm:agent="v1">And every time she's near</p>
      <p begin="00:37.820" end="00:40.210" ttm:agent="v1">I can't help but stare</p>
      <p begin="00:40.210" end="00:41.810" ttm:agent="v1">Fell in love at first sight</p>
      <p begin="00:41.810" end="00:43.310" ttm:agent="v1">I can't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:43.140" end="00:44.660" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah I got so many feelings</p>
      <p begin="00:44.660" end="00:46.320" ttm:agent="v1">I can't hide</p>
      <p begin="00:46.320" end="00:48.020" ttm:agent="v1">And I just wanna call her</p>
      <p begin="00:48.020" end="00:49.520" ttm:agent="v1">She makes me crazy</p>
      <p begin="00:49.030" end="00:51.310" ttm:agent="v1">Lost my mind right when I saw her</p>
      <p begin="00:51.310" end="00:54.370" ttm:agent="v1">And when I go to sleep at night my thoughts are all about her</p>
      <p begin="00:54.370" end="00:59.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't know what I would do if I lived life without her (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:59.020" end="01:02.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I don't want nobody else (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.530" end="01:07.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Saw her and I swear I fell so hard that I can't get up (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:07.330" end="01:09.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just want her love (Yeah)</p>
